   "msg": "tank_match.cir: zin_phase_20m_deg = 52.1019 outside [25, 45] - The architecture's OWN SIM-4 phase window, kept visible the way SIM-1's +/-0.2 V/ns ZdVS window is kept visible in classe_zvs_nominal.bounds.json. IT IS UNREACHABLE BY CONSTRUCTION, not by this board's doing: phase = atan(X_net/R), so the architecture's own x_net window of 1.0-1.6 maps to 45.0-58.0 deg and cannot overlap 25-45 deg except at the single point 45. This entry will therefore warn on every run; that is the intent - the promise stays visible and the contradiction stays on the record. The re-derived window above is the one to read. Deviation recorded in reports/sim-notes.md s7 item 1.",
